Subject: [PATCH 10/33] Tools: STRATA_BENCH_COPIES in native_expert_bench,
 tools/mtp_q2b.py

Port of opt7/integrate f9c9534e and 15adaac5 onto v0.2.9: native_expert_bench's timed calls can cycle through R
copies of the blobs (weights from VRAM, not the 96 MB Infinity Cache), with v0.2.9's BENCH_CAP launch sizing kept;
STRATA_BENCH_DUMP writes the outputs for a cross-build bitwise compare. tools/mtp_q2b.py re-rounds the MTP routed
experts' Q2_0 with a signed least-squares scale (drafts only; the installed drafter's experts were made with it).
